Type the whole letter exactly as printed, in this order:

1. the **address block** (Mojoali Brenda / P.O. Box 10000 / Old Town, Limbe / Fako Division / SW Region / 20th June 2015), one item per line, placed at the right of the page (right alignment or the right half of the page; the *th* of *20th* is superscript, which Word does by itself);
2. the salutation `Dear Crispin,`;
3. the **four paragraphs** of the letter (press *Enter* only at the end of each paragraph; first line indented);
4. the closing lines `I wait for the letter with impatience.`, `Best wishes,` and `Brenda`.

Keep the spelling and the punctuation exactly as printed (*school-leaver*, *all-around*, the comma after *one* in paragraph 2).
